WEBVTT

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.750
This drama is based on history but has creative twists

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:26.150
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.610
How could my life end like this?

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.130
Life cannot be changed by your own will

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.940
Unless you die and come back to life again

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:36.250
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.720
Hey!

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:46.350
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:40.220
Will this be his first time taking part in the ritual?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.180
Adopted?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.350
And I thought I was your hostage all this time

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.390
4th Prince Wang So...

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:56.450
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.750
will return to Shinzhu after the ritual is completed

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.970
If any stupid rumors reach the emperor,

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.410
I won't sit idly by

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.490
I won't be back

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:58.280
I will not allow myself to be a hostage in Shinzhu

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.610
Hey! You... You!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.440
Hae Soo?

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.510
It wasn't a dream

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.780
Where am I?

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:16.880
No, no...

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.040
I...

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:18.970
Who am I?

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.620
Your name is Hae Soo

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.650
Am I really in another person's body?

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.690
Do you all agree with him?

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:26.780
Speak

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:28.630
Which one of you really wants to take a seat?

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.190
the current crown prince?

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:33.670
We were given a tip that

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.170
that the crown prince will be killed during the ritual

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.950
Should I pretend to be my brother?

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.960
Then what will you promise in return?

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.690
The Crown Prince is lucky

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:45.650
He will have a long life

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.210
Mother?

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.940
Choose: marriage or son?

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.830
Is there anyone outside?!

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.160
I brought you to this place

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:05.340
I will help you until the very end

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.700
I can't go back

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.000
And I can't change anything now

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:13.840
I want to live!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.980
Well? Do you remember?

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.840
Gotta keep your mouth shut

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.520
you

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.870
look like another person

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.950
Episode 2

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:10.170
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:15.950
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.950
But I don't understand

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:22.770
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:25.370
I don't understand

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.270
Why is my heart beating fast?

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:34.570
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:41.530
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:48.150
At the same time, in the same place we will always be (We will always be)

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:54.050
Whenever you wish, I’ll be waiting there

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.100
I'm waiting

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.150
Only you alone

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.110
Stop!

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.640
Wait. Stay there

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:59.080
How can you throw people around like that, like they’re some kind of thing?

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:07.330
Hey! She said, wait!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.600
Is it possible to rush so fast along a narrow road?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:17.410
Look, just look! He moved all the people aside!

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:21.760
Previously, people only had cars. Oh, that is, horses

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.370
Is a horse more important to you than a person?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:43.110
Hey! Hey you! Hey!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.540
Wow, what was that?

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:50.510
God! Madam, forget about him!

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.360
Police... No, I'm talking about the guards

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.600
Where are they?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.980
They need to arrest that idiot!

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.340
What are you talking about? You really don’t know the 4th prince?

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:03.070
You're lucky to be alive

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.180
4th prince?

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:08.940
Prince again?

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.680
How many sons did Emperor Taejo have?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:17.900
Madam!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:20.790
Madam! Madam!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.340
What are you doing here?!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.920
Chae Ryung, who is this tall guy?

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.610
his eyes are big, have you seen?

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:29.880
He left our house

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.610
Do you know anyone who looks like this?

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:34.430
God! This is not the time to be here!

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:38.630
Princess Yong Hwa is looking for you everywhere!

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.060
Princess Yeon Hwa?

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:48.010
Looks like our 4th brother won't come

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:52.760
Sister, So scares me with his appearance,
right up to a headache

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.520
Two days ago I accidentally stepped on his foot...

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.680
- “Wanted death?”
- I was so scared

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.150
You can't be fixed

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.870
We may have only one mother,

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.470
but we never spoke normally

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:07.610
Even if I say hello to him, he won’t answer.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.640
This man knows how to spoil the mood

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.560
Brother, have you arrived?

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:02.460
I'm late

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.400
You and I need to practice for the ritual

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.690
You can

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.120
I haven't heard anything from you,

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.540
and we wanted to send someone to Shinzhu

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.370
Why didn't you get in touch?

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.230
As you can see, I have arrived

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.810
You should stay with us since you are in Songak

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.030
I want to listen to stories about Shinju

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:22.690
Yes, it will be better here than in the Empress's house

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.520
Uk, don't try

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:30.690
He understands animals much better than people

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:36.250
Ah, no wonder

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.920
Your words were very clear

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.660
Princess, the drinks are ready

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.970
What are you worth? Bring it inside

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:34.710
By any chance, have we met before?

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.960
No

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.170
-You look familiar
- No

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:49.010
You! Were you the one spying on us in the bathhouse?

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:50.700
- It can’t be
- Exactly you!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.150
No, not me!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.140
What happened?!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.500
Brother, is this girl really?

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.600
I think so, since she was so embarrassed

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.780
And she has changed

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.650
She was a careful and obedient girl

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:12.730
Yes, brother?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.170
I'm not sure, I wasn't that close to her...

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:20.510
I don't know

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.500
Eun, you're just wrong

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.010
How could she get into the bathhouse of the imperial family?

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:28.300
I remember people well

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.800
I'm sure I'm right

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.750
Here's a parasite

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.800
Would have agreed when I said no

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.050
I'm going crazy, seriously!

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:44.550
Okay, hold on.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:48.720
If you can bear it today, you'll probably
you won't see him again

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.550
What did he forget here?

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.860
Where did she run off to?

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.520
Here or there?

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.370
Stand

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:13.430
Who's there?!

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:20.810
I'm right, I was peeking

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.000
Do you suspect me? I'm a prince!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.060
Do you really think that I spied on an ordinary slave?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.980
Yes, I think

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.440
Are you sure it was me?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.890
Answer

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:46.080
Are you sure you saw me?

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.230
Well, I...

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.280
It was hard to see...

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.120
Do you see?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.580
Don't doubt the prince anymore

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:06.550
Chae Ryung might not have seen, but I saw

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.730
I understand that you are interested in women!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:12.070
Still, peeking is wrong.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.010
Apologize quickly

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.670
Apologize?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.550
Are you telling me, the prince, to apologize to the servant?

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.620
There is no such law in the country

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.810
Go away

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:27.080
Hey! Aren't you ashamed?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.940
Shameless

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.560
Me, prince?

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:34.380
What? What impudence!

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:35.570
Away!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.680
Apologize! Apologize quickly!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:45.130
Look, you're the size of a grain of rice to me.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:55.550
- Hey! Hey!
- What?

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:58.250
Hey, let go. Let me go

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.720
- Let me go, I'm serious
- Let go yourself

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:01.980
Hey!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.020
Let me go! Let go!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:09.670
ABOUT! Weren't they the ones who started the fight there?

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:12.630
God, it's Brother Eun

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.440
Let me go!

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:18.590
Like small children

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:22.340
- Let me go! Let go! I'm serious
- No, let go yourself!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.870
Well yeah, fights are always fun

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.430
Let me go, let me go!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:37.150
You! How do you like it?

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.980
- You...
- What!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.160
Hey you!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.540
Do you think they will be spared after this?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.950
Hooligan! Pervert!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:02.230
Lustful girl

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.140
Can you still talk?

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:18.460
People like you should come to their senses after the use of force

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.130
Let me go!

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:39.170
I only remember your smell and your laughter

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.670
Brother! Hold her tight

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.220
- Horrible girl
- Eun

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:37.790
Brother!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.070
The servants are there watching, maybe you should stop?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:45.620
I'm always waiting only for you, counting the days

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:50.820
And it doesn’t matter where I am now, because only you are in my thoughts

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.160
Hey don't laugh

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.950
What I dreamed about and what I wanted

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:01.350
I'm only waiting for you

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:07.520
And every day I can shout “I love you,” so what?

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.470
This... listen

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:13.130
And every day I can call you

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.660
Listen, wait!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:18.800
That moment when you stood in front of me...

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.700
You've already done this

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.920
Am I a thing to you?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.560
Apologize too

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:24.070
I love, I love, I love

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.740
Who are you?

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.240
I? Who am I?

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:30.110
I love, I love, I love

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:28.740
Hae Soo. I'm Hae Soo!

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.360
I didn't ask for the name

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.900
What class are you from that you behave this way with the prince?

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.280
I asked to apologize

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:37.610
why are you asking me this?

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.470
If it's a servant, will you ignore it, and if it's a princess, will you apologize?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.940
What a funny place this is

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.400
So, do you want to hear an apology?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.840
Yes, and not only from you, but also from that little prince

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.260
And let him apologize

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.660
The higher you are, the more you need to care about justice

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.700
Don't agree?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.410
Okay

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.720
But

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:07.080
as soon as you hear the apology,

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.550
then you'll die right away

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:17.010
This is normal, right?

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:21.870
Then...

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:25.420
- Sorry me...
- Sister!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.890
You were looking for me, right?

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.910
Let's go, let's go.
Let's talk to you

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.270
Let's go, let's go

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.650
Hae Soo?

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:12.640
The reason is not important

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:15.660
you hit the emperor's son

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.900
Punishment cannot be avoided

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:21.890
Maybe

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:24.640
my husband will be punished too

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:30.570
Can't you help me?

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:34.860
I will try to explain everything to the emperor

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.880
Do you think it's that easy to meet him?

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:44.110
I don't know how you changed so much

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.990
You were such an obedient girl

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:57.410
Mothers from all over Songak come here to pray for the well-being of their children

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.980
Haven't you thought about why I came here?

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:04.350
without having children?

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:14.020
This belongs to Empress Hwangbo,

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:16.880
she prayed for Prince and Princess Yeon Hwa

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.770
And this

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.350
I made it for you

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.400
For me?

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:35.360
When you first came to our house,

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.360
I found out that you grew up alone

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:46.730
You didn't have a mother, so I didn't see you as a sister,

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.170
I thought of you as my child

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:56.920
Your mom would do this if she were here.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.710
So I did it for her

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:06.470
But today I feel like my efforts weren't enough

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.310
Your mother is watching us, so what should I do?

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:14.940
I'm ashamed

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.630
Mom...

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:24.980
My mom...

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.480
Su

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.930
Please...

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.350
What should I do with you?

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.250
Think about your mother

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:04.280
Try to live right

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:08.920
Mom...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:12.190
Yes

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:36.950
Go Ha Jin, anywhere you become a burden

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:40.790
Everyone is nice to you, but you cause trouble.

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.420
Can I come back?

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:49.070
If I could, I would want to

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.350
Mom is waiting for me

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.280
Madam!

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.980
Madam, what are you doing here?

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:02.810
It's cold, let's go inside

00:22:03.310 --> 00:22:06.130
Chae Ryung, the person I asked about,

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.640
still don't know who he is?

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:10.940
He was among the princes

00:22:10.940 --> 00:22:12.210
Not sure

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:14.910
There are many visitors to our house

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:19.640
I think you need to take a bath

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:25.480
The place where I was injured...
did you say this is a bathhouse?

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:29.090
It's a girl! Young woman!

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:32.130
It's a girl!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:34.270
Hurry up, madam

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:36.980
This is not the time!

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:40.150
This is the largest bathhouse in all of Songak!

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:44.570
You can't go there!

00:22:44.570 --> 00:22:47.180
I have a bad feeling! Why would you go back there?

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:50.040
I'll get you some water so you can take a bath here.

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:54.960
I saw this man before I died

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:03.640
There will be a bruise, very bright

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:05.720
Possibly dark blue

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:09.160
You are more charming than any painting

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:13.200
I won't let her get away with this

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:15.280
How dare she hit the prince?

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:19.560
You said that your enemy is Miss Su?

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:23.070
From what I heard she's alive

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:25.170
You won't find them like this during the day

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:27.820
- You experienced rare feelings
- That's right

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:30.670
It's hard to recognize a person you've seen once in your life

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:32.710
It's hard to experience them when you're being beaten

00:23:32.710 --> 00:23:35.310
You may have met your destiny, Eun

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.310
Fate? What else?

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:40.690
She is my fateful enemy!

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:43.150
Brother, you don't know women well

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:45.890
If she wasn't interested in you, she wouldn't touch you.

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:50.830
Then...

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:55.690
Did she beat me up because she was interested in me?

00:23:55.690 --> 00:23:57.780
Well, maybe so. Or maybe not

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:07.370
Damiwon Palace

00:24:35.670 --> 00:24:36.670
Your Highness!

00:25:07.220 --> 00:25:09.090
I wanted to greet you, mother

00:25:13.000 --> 00:25:15.150
Empress Yu

00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:22.610
Are you doing well?

00:25:22.610 --> 00:25:24.570
I heard you arrived

00:25:24.570 --> 00:25:26.380
I would call you

00:25:26.380 --> 00:25:29.960
I've already met all the brothers and thought I should visit you

00:25:32.580 --> 00:25:36.710
Mother, it seems that brother has been studying martial arts a lot lately.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:39.270
- Martial arts?
- Yes

00:25:39.270 --> 00:25:42.460
He was perfect when we practiced for the ritual

00:25:42.460 --> 00:25:45.250
There are rumors...

00:25:47.240 --> 00:25:48.850
These are just rumors

00:25:48.850 --> 00:25:52.850
Eun mentioned that the government in Shinju is becoming obsolete, and he also said some other nonsense

00:25:56.690 --> 00:25:58.200
Tell me

00:25:59.750 --> 00:26:01.430
Are you studying martial arts?

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:04.670
I shouldn't

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:07.300
And it's true

00:26:08.230 --> 00:26:10.590
You weren't raised to be a tiger

00:26:10.590 --> 00:26:12.820
Why teach you martial arts?

00:26:14.610 --> 00:26:19.260
Mother, have you heard that there is a Wolf in Songak?

00:26:19.260 --> 00:26:23.630
They say he's disgusting to look at, worse than any dog

00:26:23.630 --> 00:26:25.270
Did this rumor come from Shinzhu?

00:26:29.640 --> 00:26:32.970
You haven't been in the capital for a long time, so enjoy being here

00:26:32.970 --> 00:26:35.900
I saved a gift for your mother

00:26:35.900 --> 00:26:39.360
You don't have to come see me again if you're here.

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:40.800
Go

00:26:42.110 --> 00:26:44.750
We haven’t seen each other for 2 years, and you’re already sending me away?

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:49.610
It's because of your foster mother who is suffering without you.

00:26:55.940 --> 00:26:58.110
I plan to stay here longer

00:26:58.110 --> 00:27:00.400
Why don't I stay in the palace with my brothers?

00:27:00.400 --> 00:27:01.920
It's impossible

00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:04.570
You are from the Kang family in Shinju

00:27:04.570 --> 00:27:06.700
I forgot that your return

00:27:06.700 --> 00:27:10.060
will it affect the long-standing animosity between the two houses?

00:27:13.470 --> 00:27:15.140
Are you saying I was adopted?

00:27:16.230 --> 00:27:17.710
I was a hostage

00:27:25.750 --> 00:27:29.280
What nonsense is this? He says he was a hostage?

00:27:30.460 --> 00:27:35.190
Your mother is just worried about your adoptive mother.

00:27:35.190 --> 00:27:36.920
Yo is right

00:27:38.320 --> 00:27:40.560
Why would I send you as a hostage?

00:27:44.460 --> 00:27:47.310
If you say so, I should believe you

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:51.240
- By the way, I...
- Mother

00:27:52.260 --> 00:27:54.480
I have prepared a gift for you

00:28:02.080 --> 00:28:03.560
God!

00:28:04.590 --> 00:28:07.960
Jeong, I really like it

00:28:09.770 --> 00:28:12.480
Do you really like hair jewelry?

00:28:12.480 --> 00:28:16.480
that's why I specially ordered a gift for you at the market

00:28:16.480 --> 00:28:18.350
Wear it for the ritual

00:28:22.760 --> 00:28:23.880
Thank you

00:28:24.940 --> 00:28:26.330
I guess I'll go

00:28:32.100 --> 00:28:34.970
How can a prince look so modest?

00:28:34.970 --> 00:28:37.940
There's nothing more awkward

00:28:56.660 --> 00:29:00.740
When the ritual is over, make sure he goes back home

00:29:01.670 --> 00:29:03.220
If he insists on staying,

00:29:04.440 --> 00:29:08.590
call the guards and let them throw him out of my sight

00:29:08.590 --> 00:29:10.160
Don't worry about it

00:29:10.160 --> 00:29:12.420
What rights does he have to stay?

00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:14.750
You know?

00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:18.300
There are so many rumors about So in the markets

00:29:18.300 --> 00:29:22.760
There are people who say that it was our mother who gave him the scar.

00:29:25.320 --> 00:29:26.840
How is this possible?

00:29:27.670 --> 00:29:32.140
Jeong, if you're going to come back with rumors, it's better not to leave the palace at all.

00:29:32.930 --> 00:29:34.150
Okay

00:29:41.970 --> 00:29:43.250
Prince So

00:29:47.950 --> 00:29:53.950
Choi Chi Mon

00:29:49.710 --> 00:29:52.340
Have you still not washed yourself before the ritual?

00:29:53.170 --> 00:29:55.490
Prepare a bath for the 4th prince

00:29:55.490 --> 00:29:56.760
Yes sir

00:30:03.510 --> 00:30:07.660
When did So get this scar?

00:30:09.020 --> 00:30:10.730
- You know?
- No

00:30:10.730 --> 00:30:11.750
I know about him

00:30:11.750 --> 00:30:13.750
Yes, I know about mine too

00:30:23.740 --> 00:30:26.440
It was definitely that homeless ahjusshi

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:30.520
Since I saw the same person, this could be the beginning of something new

00:30:30.520 --> 00:30:33.050
I can still live in the future

00:30:33.050 --> 00:30:35.410
Maybe I can go back

00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:39.660
There's only one way to find out

00:30:47.260 --> 00:30:49.500
I hit the prince

00:30:49.500 --> 00:30:51.760
I need to get back before my legs and arms are cut off

00:30:52.580 --> 00:30:56.740
It was very difficult to be here

00:32:22.250 --> 00:32:25.140
I'm alive! I thought I was going to die!

00:32:47.060 --> 00:32:48.280
Did you see it?

00:33:08.160 --> 00:33:10.230
Have you seen it?

00:33:12.910 --> 00:33:16.320
Please have mercy

00:33:23.430 --> 00:33:27.350
Forget me

00:33:28.690 --> 00:33:30.130
Erase everything

00:33:30.130 --> 00:33:31.690
If not...

00:33:33.190 --> 00:33:35.200
your face will look like this too

00:34:08.600 --> 00:34:10.750
Heart is pounding

00:34:26.080 --> 00:34:28.020
Has the 4th prince already left?

00:34:28.020 --> 00:34:29.420
Let's clean it up

00:34:56.980 --> 00:34:58.680
Madam Su!

00:35:06.660 --> 00:35:08.510
Where have you been?

00:35:08.510 --> 00:35:11.920
Were you all waiting for me?

00:35:11.920 --> 00:35:14.190
Where have you been?

00:35:15.640 --> 00:35:19.330
I was very dirty. I went to wash myself

00:35:20.710 --> 00:35:22.620
You need to tell people where you are going

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:24.520
The whole family was worried

00:35:26.270 --> 00:35:28.560
Family?

00:35:33.040 --> 00:35:36.140
Take the lady inside and keep her warm

00:35:36.140 --> 00:35:38.400
Yes. Let's go

00:35:38.570 --> 00:35:39.600
Yes

00:35:53.060 --> 00:35:54.680
Come inside

00:35:56.180 --> 00:35:57.460
I...

00:35:59.640 --> 00:36:01.740
I think I'm home

00:36:10.340 --> 00:36:12.410
- Let's go
- Yes

00:36:15.880 --> 00:36:18.450
Do you know how to create problems?

00:36:18.450 --> 00:36:20.830
I told you not to go there

00:36:20.830 --> 00:36:26.080
Chae Ryung, do you know the 4th Prince?

00:36:27.230 --> 00:36:28.330
What kind of person is he?

00:36:28.330 --> 00:36:29.940
Did you run into him at the bathhouse?

00:36:29.940 --> 00:36:31.500
What are you talking about?

00:36:32.010 --> 00:36:35.260
I know that in Koryo it is very possible

00:36:35.260 --> 00:36:37.510
meet a man and a woman in the bath

00:36:37.510 --> 00:36:41.330
You must run away as soon as you see the 4th prince

00:36:41.330 --> 00:36:43.030
Run away? Why?

00:36:43.030 --> 00:36:44.900
His mother is Empress Yu

00:36:44.900 --> 00:36:47.710
He was adopted by Imperial Concubine Kang in Shinzhu

00:36:47.710 --> 00:36:50.680
He is a powerful man who has two families

00:36:50.680 --> 00:36:53.560
Known for his cruelty

00:36:54.380 --> 00:37:00.570
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:37:00.570 --> 00:37:02.130
Your Highness!

00:37:14.400 --> 00:37:17.250
He's not dead? Is he alive?

00:37:25.250 --> 00:37:29.170
They say he loved to hunt animals since childhood

00:37:29.170 --> 00:37:33.220
Rumor has it that he killed all the wolves in Shinzhu

00:37:37.720 --> 00:37:39.910
They say he kills people with ease

00:37:39.910 --> 00:37:42.860
Especially those who saw the scar on his face

00:37:42.860 --> 00:37:44.230
Those who saw his scar?

00:37:45.610 --> 00:37:48.210
Then I'm dead

00:37:48.210 --> 00:37:50.310
I saw him without a mask

00:37:51.110 --> 00:37:55.150
He wouldn't even be able to set foot in Songak if he weren't a prince

00:37:55.150 --> 00:37:57.420
- What a relief
- Why?

00:37:58.190 --> 00:38:01.430
If you have a scar on your face, you can't go anywhere you want?

00:38:01.430 --> 00:38:04.770
What is possible? People only love pretty faces

00:38:06.110 --> 00:38:09.040
You need to be wealthy to survive. Even at this time

00:38:09.040 --> 00:38:10.570
Just like in our world

00:38:10.590 --> 00:38:12.540
Stupid world!

00:38:32.590 --> 00:38:37.200
We would not need to rush so much if the question of abdication had not arisen

00:38:37.710 --> 00:38:40.060
He has always been a strong player

00:38:40.060 --> 00:38:42.680
What will happen when he dies?

00:38:42.680 --> 00:38:45.740
This opportunity doesn't come around often

00:38:46.700 --> 00:38:49.900
We need to finish him off during the ritual.

00:38:51.050 --> 00:38:53.010
Don't worry about it

00:38:59.070 --> 00:39:03.030
Will only the crown prince attend the ritual of exorcising evil spirits?

00:39:11.510 --> 00:39:17.620
Exorcism ritual: an ancient rite to expel evil spirits during the 12th lunar month

00:39:54.680 --> 00:39:56.390
- Are you finished?
- No

00:39:58.190 --> 00:39:59.340
Are you done?

00:40:15.880 --> 00:40:17.030
Welcome

00:40:55.210 --> 00:41:00.510
No woman should shine brighter than me today

00:41:02.150 --> 00:41:04.840
If someone stands out...

00:41:08.600 --> 00:41:10.930
although I don't think that will happen

00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:34.450
Three flowers bloomed in the palace

00:41:35.230 --> 00:41:37.820
Queen Hwangbo

00:41:39.230 --> 00:41:41.000
you look more elegant today

00:41:41.000 --> 00:41:45.130
Empress Yu, you are very beautiful today

00:41:46.360 --> 00:41:47.720
Princess Yeon Hwa

00:41:47.720 --> 00:41:50.430
visit not only your mother, but also visit me

00:41:50.430 --> 00:41:52.500
Tell me funny stories about what's happening in the world

00:41:53.230 --> 00:41:55.810
Princes aren't very good at these things

00:41:55.810 --> 00:41:58.400
I'm afraid my speaking skills are not enough to entertain you

00:41:58.400 --> 00:42:00.950
I will visit you soon and have funny stories in store

00:42:00.950 --> 00:42:02.020
I'll be looking forward to it

00:42:02.800 --> 00:42:04.170
Well, shall we go?

00:42:04.650 --> 00:42:05.990
Let's go to the emperor

00:42:23.910 --> 00:42:27.870
In daylight she looks completely different

00:42:29.930 --> 00:42:34.310
I'm worried about you fighting alone in the palace

00:42:35.290 --> 00:42:38.190
Brother should quickly come to your side

00:42:39.630 --> 00:42:42.900
This is a palace. You need to be careful with your words

00:42:42.900 --> 00:42:45.010
Your sister-in-law is right

00:42:45.010 --> 00:42:47.440
You're still not prepared

00:42:48.250 --> 00:42:50.390
It will be better for you to forget everything

00:42:52.210 --> 00:42:54.410
How can I forget such an insult?

00:42:57.590 --> 00:43:00.030
Why didn't you bring Hae Soo?

00:43:00.030 --> 00:43:04.800
The whole palace already knows about the mess she caused.

00:43:06.190 --> 00:43:08.700
She made a lot of mistakes because of her illness

00:43:08.700 --> 00:43:11.170
I left her to have fun alone

00:43:12.890 --> 00:43:17.180
Okay, the emperor is waiting. Let's hurry up

00:43:41.940 --> 00:43:45.310
The Emperor will be proud to see you all

00:43:45.720 --> 00:43:48.490
After the ceremony is over there will be a great feast

00:43:48.490 --> 00:43:50.160
Yes, Crown Prince

00:43:52.770 --> 00:43:57.650
Wook, will your wife and Hae Soo be present too?

00:43:57.650 --> 00:43:59.920
I think so

00:44:00.800 --> 00:44:02.000
Really?

00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:05.420
And what? Do you want to get punched again?

00:44:06.330 --> 00:44:10.230
No. This time I'm going to tell her everything I think.

00:44:10.230 --> 00:44:13.890
Do you want another black eye?

00:44:19.940 --> 00:44:21.180
Don't laugh

00:44:21.790 --> 00:44:23.570
I told you to stop!

00:44:25.670 --> 00:44:27.060
Get out!

00:44:32.460 --> 00:44:35.200
Oh my god... oh

00:44:36.570 --> 00:44:39.300
Brother, brother! Are you okay?

00:44:39.300 --> 00:44:41.130
Gotcha

00:44:41.130 --> 00:44:42.970
You're still no match for me

00:44:46.170 --> 00:44:49.110
How dare you? To big brother...

00:44:50.640 --> 00:44:52.820
You two stop

00:45:30.310 --> 00:45:35.050
Fangxiangshi - the main character of the action before the ritual, who hunts demons

00:46:10.970 --> 00:46:14.820
Jin Zha - the prince who rules the ritual

00:46:16.100 --> 00:46:19.220
Chang Soo - Evil Spirit Conjurer

00:46:40.970 --> 00:46:43.030
All Jin Zha have gathered

00:46:43.030 --> 00:46:46.240
Now we will drive away the evil spirits

00:47:56.310 --> 00:47:59.770
The Crown Prince is very good in this role

00:48:00.290 --> 00:48:03.770
He practically lived on the battlefields

00:48:56.940 --> 00:48:58.670
Stomach takes medicine

00:48:58.670 --> 00:49:00.250
The spirit eats the bear's flesh

00:49:00.250 --> 00:49:02.160
Buddha absorbs light

00:49:02.160 --> 00:49:06.360
We will call upon the 12 Gods and destroy evil spirits and diseases

00:49:06.360 --> 00:49:08.300
I will destroy you

00:49:08.300 --> 00:49:11.690
I'll pierce your liver and cut your flesh

00:49:11.690 --> 00:49:14.620
I'll take your insides out

00:49:29.730 --> 00:49:32.120
Protect the Emperor!

00:50:48.800 --> 00:50:50.090
Mu!

00:51:26.560 --> 00:51:27.720
Catch them!

00:51:35.410 --> 00:51:37.280
Imperial Army, follow me!

00:51:38.420 --> 00:51:39.880
Crown Prince!

00:51:41.920 --> 00:51:43.200
Mu!

00:51:49.100 --> 00:51:52.180
You... You are the 4th prince

00:51:58.090 --> 00:51:59.930
Where is the crown prince?

00:52:02.050 --> 00:52:03.810
Where is he?

00:52:07.380 --> 00:52:08.870
I'm here, my emperor

00:52:22.710 --> 00:52:24.570
Are you okay, 4th Prince?

00:52:42.960 --> 00:52:44.350
Co

00:52:48.240 --> 00:52:49.690
I'll catch them

00:53:06.120 --> 00:53:07.670
Crown Prince

00:53:28.840 --> 00:53:31.090
Look here! And so!

00:53:31.090 --> 00:53:32.370
And this is it

00:54:22.190 --> 00:54:24.620
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:54:27.190 --> 00:54:28.280
Honey or sugar?

00:54:28.280 --> 00:54:29.790
One, two, three. Honey!

00:54:29.790 --> 00:54:30.970
Certainly!

00:54:30.970 --> 00:54:31.970
This is it

00:54:43.640 --> 00:54:46.030
Let's get some rest please

00:54:46.030 --> 00:54:49.870
I won't be able to get married. I'll be blown apart

00:54:49.870 --> 00:54:53.790
You are much younger than me. Why are you in such bad shape?

00:54:53.790 --> 00:54:55.800
We're only a year apart

00:54:56.580 --> 00:54:59.210
Oh, really?

00:55:14.910 --> 00:55:17.190
Chae Ryung, wait here for me

00:55:17.190 --> 00:55:19.620
Madam! Madam Su!

00:57:41.870 --> 00:57:44.270
Do you think you'll come out of the forest alive?

00:57:44.270 --> 00:57:46.830
Who is behind all this, speak up

00:57:46.830 --> 00:57:51.270
And then I will ask the emperor to have mercy on you

00:57:56.820 --> 00:58:00.060
I am the 4th Prince Wang So

00:58:01.040 --> 00:58:02.860
This is the prince's promise

00:58:21.840 --> 00:58:26.120
There... there are people... people...

00:58:37.680 --> 00:58:38.810
Kill

00:58:42.560 --> 00:58:44.060
Kill her

00:58:47.770 --> 00:58:52.160
Then... will I kill?

00:59:08.830 --> 00:59:11.300
P-sp-spare me

00:59:11.300 --> 00:59:14.260
I really could die

00:59:15.350 --> 00:59:18.900
I don't care what she says

00:59:19.840 --> 00:59:23.210
Stop being silly. Tell me, who is behind this?

00:59:25.170 --> 00:59:26.470
Now!

01:00:14.920 --> 01:00:16.740
Why?!

01:00:21.540 --> 01:00:23.780
I almost split it

01:00:24.490 --> 01:00:26.660
It's because of you!

01:00:42.310 --> 01:00:43.410
Enough is enough

01:00:45.530 --> 01:00:48.630
She's innocent, let her go

01:01:06.670 --> 01:01:08.250
I don't want to

01:01:21.850 --> 01:01:27.850
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

01:01:21.850 --> 01:01:27.850
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

01:01:28.050 --> 01:01:34.370
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

01:01:28.850 --> 01:01:31.250
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

01:01:31.640 --> 01:01:34.280
They are connected by a fate that they do not know about

01:01:34.280 --> 01:01:36.900
Because of his intervention, everything didn't go according to plan.

01:01:34.370 --> 01:01:40.150
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

01:01:36.900 --> 01:01:38.710
Keep an eye on him

01:01:38.710 --> 01:01:41.910
Is that you? You wanted to kill the crown prince

01:01:40.150 --> 01:01:43.150
But I don't understand

01:01:41.910 --> 01:01:44.040
Idiot, want to blame me?

01:01:43.150 --> 01:01:46.970
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

01:01:44.650 --> 01:01:47.920
Koryo should belong to my son

01:01:46.970 --> 01:01:49.570
I don't understand

01:01:47.920 --> 01:01:49.990
What do you need now?

01:01:49.570 --> 01:01:52.470
Why is my heart beating fast?

01:01:49.990 --> 01:01:53.090
You're the first girl to treat me like that

01:01:52.470 --> 01:01:58.770
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

01:01:53.090 --> 01:01:55.150
There should be no scars on a girl's body

01:01:55.150 --> 01:01:56.970
Don't worry about me

01:01:56.970 --> 01:01:58.900
I'll take care of myself

01:01:58.900 --> 01:02:02.280
You know very well about my feelings... for you

01:01:58.950 --> 01:02:05.670
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

01:02:02.280 --> 01:02:03.630
Are you happy?

01:02:03.630 --> 01:02:04.760
My heart is beating fast

01:02:04.760 --> 01:02:07.270
I'm looking forward to meeting this girl

01:02:06.290 --> 01:02:11.710
And look at me easily
